\\\"average\\\"}\",\"Elements\":\"When the type is line, table, stackArea, singleStat, histogram, it contains elements key and the value is an object array.\\nExample:[{\\\"expression\\\":\\\"sum(up)\\\",\\\"legend\\\":\\\"test\\\"}]\"}}', 1, NULL);

